<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">MY FACTORY</view><view class="title">我的工厂</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{user}}" class="card">
    <view class="name">{{user.workspaceName}}</view>
    <view class="label">当前账号</view><view>{{user.displayName || user.username}}（{{user.username}}）</view>
    <view class="label">角色</view><view>{{user.role === 'manager' ? '经理' : '员工'}}</view>
    <view class="label">当前服务</view><view class="muted">{{server}}</view>
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="logout" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">{{cloud ? '退出登录' : '退出登录 / 更换服务器'}}</button>
  </view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="home">查看公司介绍</button>
  <view class="notice gap">与网站共用账号、工厂数据和生产规则。订单创建、机器关联在网站操作；小程序下拉刷新获取最新进度。时间按北京时间显示。</view>
</view>
